dist/
# Codegen output from `pnpm generate` (openapi-typescript against
# packages/contracts/openapi.json). Regenerated on every build/test run —
# see the `pretest`/`prebuild` scripts in package.json — the same way
# apps/gallery's own .astro/ generated types are gitignored rather than
# committed. Unlike packages/contracts/openapi.json itself (PHP-derived,
# committed, CI-diffed for drift), this file has no independent source of
# truth to drift from: it is a pure function of the already-committed
# contract, so committing it would just be a second copy to keep in sync.
src/generated/
